Success Criteria

The redesigned Agent Collector Scanner should:

Reduce the visible information on the main page by approximately 60–70% while keeping all capabilities accessible.
Allow a first-time administrator to deploy and connect a collector in under five minutes.
Separate Collector Management, Scanning, Operations, and Cryptographic Policies into clearly defined modules with intuitive navigation.
Use progressive disclosure so advanced configuration appears only when explicitly requested.
Maintain complete backward compatibility with existing APIs, telemetry streams, RBAC, audit logging, and remediation workflows.
Deliver a polished, enterprise-grade experience comparable to leading cybersecurity platforms while preserving QGuard Helix's advanced post-quantum capabilities.

This redesign should be suitable for enterprise production deployment and reflect the usability standards expected by government agencies, financial institutions, regulated industries, and Fortune 500 organizations.